    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Narrow belts, cords, sashes or the like, usually decorative and worn at the waist to fasten or confine garments or as a means of carrying small objects such as purses or keys. [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
